+# #410 first native baseline
+
+**Incomplete.** W1 reproduced the stale terminal parent wait and W3's live controls completed. The fixture stopped during historical seed preparation after the live gateway shut down. W2's interruption and W4's historical reopen were never reached.
+
+## Bound execution and exits
+
+The frozen runtime checkout used actual main `154401c7b47c1e56b62a6daec50e2a3145ea967d` and tree `7e611f71ac8b3693d574b8f08869d68fed19af4b`. The only actual build was the admitted `pnpm.cmd build --force` on project Node v22.23.4, with child exit 0 at 19:41:14.391 UTC. Build preflight 01 refused an external basename before spawning a build. Build admission 02 produced the binding used here. The native launcher verified the opening and closing maps for 28,329 source files, the index, Node, 1,231 files in 13 output roots, 17 selected dependency files and 22 workspace links. All six primary admission-bound runtime entry hashes matched the harness's declared hashes. [Build refusal](C:/Users/98jak/graphgoblin-qa/2026-11-13-aidlc-batch/runtime-410-build-baseline-admission-01-refusal.json) · [Build exit](C:/Users/98jak/graphgoblin-qa/2026-11-13-aidlc-batch/runtime-410-build-baseline-review-01/build-exit.json) · [Build binding](C:/Users/98jak/graphgoblin-qa/2026-11-13-aidlc-batch/runtime-410-build-baseline-review-01/build-binding.json) · [Launch preflight](C:/Users/98jak/graphgoblin-qa/2026-11-13-aidlc-batch/runtime-410-launch-execution-baseline-review-01/preflight.json) · [Closing receipt](C:/Users/98jak/graphgoblin-qa/2026-11-13-aidlc-batch/runtime-410-launch-execution-baseline-review-01/launch-result.json)
+
+I first invoked the launcher with a forward-slash admission path. It exited 1 before the Node version probe and created neither planned output directory. Root separately authorized the canonical-backslash invocation of the same admission, which started the sole native supervisor. Wrapper PID 54392 exited 1, observed in command completion chunk `2a891e`. Supervisor PID 36140's separately persisted OS exit was 1 at 19:46:47.610952 UTC with no deadline. The wrapper completed post-exit binding and reported `wrapperStatus: incomplete` and `harnessResult: incomplete`. Its stderr and stdout files were both empty. [Invocation refusal](C:/Users/98jak/graphgoblin-qa/2026-11-13-aidlc-batch/runtime-410-native-baseline-launch-preflight-refusal-01.md) · [Canonical invocation authorization](C:/Users/98jak/graphgoblin-qa/2026-11-13-aidlc-batch/runtime-410-native-baseline-launch-canonical-authorization-01.json) · [Launch identity](C:/Users/98jak/graphgoblin-qa/2026-11-13-aidlc-batch/runtime-410-launch-execution-baseline-review-01/launch.json) · [Supervisor OS exit](C:/Users/98jak/graphgoblin-qa/2026-11-13-aidlc-batch/runtime-410-launch-execution-baseline-review-01/child-exit.json) · [Derived closing receipt](C:/Users/98jak/graphgoblin-qa/2026-11-13-aidlc-batch/runtime-410-launch-execution-baseline-review-01/launch-result.json)
